{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d205a06a-e09b-8713-895e-1066bbf496a2",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T10:32:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ileana Ortiz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:30:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, thank you for taking my call. I would like to report a problem with a crosswalk, please. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:30:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Where is the crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:30:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 456 Bellevue Avenue, right in front of the house. The paint has faded very badly, and the cars do not stop for people crossing. Thank you for asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, faded crosswalk at 456 Bellevue. Is it worn away completely, or just dim?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is almost gone, I would say. You can see only a few pieces of the white lines. Sorry, one moment please. [pause] No, sweetheart, not under the couch, look by the door. I apologize, my daughter is looking for her mitten. Thank you for waiting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, mittens go missing this time of year. Is this a marked crosswalk with signs, or just the painted lines?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:31:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is one sign on the post, but the lines are the main thing. I do have photos on my phone, if those would be helpful. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:31:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They would. I'll give you where to send them in a second. I'll put in the request now so a crew can look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:31:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. May I ask how long repairs like this usually take? I appreciate your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:31:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly it varies. Line painting usually depends on the weather, and it's cold out, so it may wait for warmer days. Once it's inspected they can tell you more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Thank you for explaining that. Should I use this number if someone needs to reach me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:32:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The number you're calling from is on my screen, so I've got it. Someone will follow up about the photos."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful, thank you. I appreciate your time. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T10:32:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Ortiz. Bye now."
    }
  ],
